  'Persiapan intensif masuk Perguruan Tinggi favorit Nasional dan Global. Fokus pada bimbingan UTBK, persiapan TOEFL/IELTS, serta pendampingan penulisan Esai Motivasi untuk tembus ke kampus impian seperti Telkom University, UGM, ITB, hingga Universitas Luar Negeri.': 'Intensive preparation for leading universities in Indonesia and abroad. Focused support includes UTBK coaching, TOEFL/IELTS preparation, and motivation essay writing for applications to dream campuses such as Telkom University, UGM, ITB, and universities overseas.',
